  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">B4D-Feasibility PPP in Ethiopia with Omega Farm</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">B4D-F&#xf6;rstudie Kik&#xe4;rtorPPP - Omega farm- Etiopien</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen g&#xe4;ller en f&#xf6;rstudie inf&#xf6;r ett f&#xf6;rslag till B4D st&#xf6;d som      avser en storskalig produktion av kik&#xe4;rtor d&#xe4;r ett potentiellt PPDP   med bidrag fr&#xe5;n Sida. Insatsen skall fokusera p&#xe5; sm&#xe5;skaliga           b&#xf6;nder,deras jordbruksorganisationer och utveckling av                samh&#xe4;llsservice.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution concerns a feasibility study for a proposed B4D      support relating to a large-scale production of chickpeas with a      potentially PPDP with funding from Sida, would focus on capacity      development for small-scale farmers, agricultural organizations and   the development of community services.</narrative>
  </description>
